        "operationId": "minimum_wage_changes",
        "summary": "Minimum wage change feed",
        "description": "Every scheduled minimum wage change between from and to (default: the next 12 months), with the previous and new rate and the source, plus pending: changes that are scheduled but whose amount isn't published yet. Poll it monthly, or before January 1 and July 1, to update rates ahead of time. Supports format=csv. Business plan and above.",
